            "CQ1": "INVOICMessage contains representsInvoice which is an Invoice; traverse hasHeader/hasDetail/hasSummary for full content. Segments (LINSegment, PRISegment, QTYSegment, MOASegment, etc.) and Section Control (UNSSegment) allow listing of all invoices and items.",
            "CQ2": "Invoice involvesOrganization and hasOrganizationRoleAssignment (linked to Organization). NADSegment provides participant details.",
            "CQ3": "OrganizationRoleAssignment links Organization and AgentRole; assignedRole specifies role S for Organization. NADSegment qualifiers distinguish roles.",
            "CQ4": "AgentRole with isBuyer property points to Organization; or OrganizationRoleAssignment with assignedRole Buyer. NADSegment qualifier 'BY' identifies Buyer.",
            "CQ5": "Organization hasAddress, hasGLNIdentifier; OrganizationRoleAssignment gives roles; details via NADSegment and Address. PCI, LOC, and PAC segments provide additional details.",
            "CQ6": "Buyer Organization hasAddress property; link via OrganizationRoleAssignment and AgentRole. Address details from NADSegment and Address class.",
            "CQ7": "InvoiceDetail hasLineItem linked to LineItem, which soldItem Item. LINSegment and IMDSegment provide item details.",
