            "CQ11": "InvoiceSummary hasInvoiceAmount (xsd:decimal). MOASegment provides monetary amount details.",
            "CQ12": "InvoiceHeader hasInvoiceNumber (xsd:string). BGMSegment and RFFSegment provide document and reference numbers.",
