2026-03-03 07:37:26 | DEBUG    |     Args: {
      "key": "cq_coverage",
      "value": {
            "CQ1": "INVOICMessage contains representsInvoice which is an Invoice; traverse hasHeader/hasDetail/hasSummary for full content. Segments (LINSegment, PRISegment, QTYSegment, MOASegment, etc.), Section Control (UNSSegment), and SegmentGroup containers allow listing of all invoices and items.",
            "CQ2": "Invoice involvesOrganization and hasOrganizationRoleAssignment (linked to Organization). NADSegment provides participant details, with C080Composite (Party Name) and C059Composite (Street) for full address and identity.",
            "CQ3": "OrganizationRoleAssignment links Organization and AgentRole; assignedRole specifies role S for Organization. NADSegment qualifiers and segment group context specify roles.",
            "CQ4": "AgentRole with isBuyer property points to Organization; or OrganizationRoleAssignment with assignedRole Buyer. NADSegment qualifier 'BY' identifies Buyer, and segment group context disambiguates roles.",
            "CQ5": "Organization hasAddress, hasGLNIdentifier; OrganizationRoleAssignment gives roles; details via NADSegment and Address. PCI, LOC, PAC segments provide additional details. Segment groups ensure correct context.",
            "CQ6": "Buyer Organization hasAddress property; link via OrganizationRoleAssignment and AgentRole. Address details from NADSegment and Address class, with C059Composite for street details.",
            "CQ7": "InvoiceDetail hasLineItem linked to LineItem, which soldItem Item. LINSegment and IMDSegment provide item details, with C082Composite and C212Composite for item numbers.",
            "CQ8": "Item has properties via LineItem (net price, quantity); further details from CompositeDataElements and Segments (PRI, MOA, QTY, MEA, PIA). PRISegment and C509Composite hold price details.",
            "CQ9": "LineItem hasNetPrice (Price), hasQuantity (xsd:decimal). PRISegment and MOASegment provide price and monetary details. Arithmetic constraints validate sums.",
            "CQ10": "InvoiceHeader, InvoiceDetail, InvoiceSummary aggregate invoice details (dates, numbers, totals). Segments like DTM, MOA, TAX, ALI, ALC, etc., and segment groups provide additional details.",
            "CQ11": "InvoiceSummary hasInvoiceAmount (xsd:decimal). MOASegment provides monetary amount details, validated by CrossSegmentArithmeticConstraint.",
            "CQ12": "InvoiceHeader hasInvoiceNumber (xsd:string). BGMSegment and RFFSegment provide document and reference numbers, with RFF-DTM group context.",
            "CQ13": "Structure: InterchangeEnvelope > Message > Segment/SegmentGroup > CompositeDataElement > SimpleDataElement; all required identifiers (GLN, InvoiceNumber, etc.) and mandatory fields per D96A. UNB, UNZ, UNH, UNT, UNS, NAD, DTM, MOA, QTY, TAX, CUX, LIN, PRI, PAC, PCI, LOC, ALC, ALI, TOD, PIA, IMD, MEA, DOC, FTX, PYT, GIS, DIS, and segment groups and composites ensure format validity. CodeListValidator and ConditionalLogicHandler enforce correctness.",
            "CQ14": "Invoice hasBusinessProcess (linked to BusinessProcess class, e.g., Procurement). TODSegment, DOCSegment, and BusinessProcess class link to business process assignment. Hierarchical segment groups and orchestration classes ensure correct process context."
      }
}
