            "4": "Buyer in the invoice is represented by Organization with an OrganizationRoleAssignment having hasRole BuyerRole.",
            "5": "Organization information is displayed via Organization, Address, GlobalLocationNumber, and their properties.",
            "6": "Buyer's address is modeled via Organization hasAddress HeadquartersAddress or WarehouseAddress.",
            "7": "Sold items are modeled as LineItem (P2PItem subclass) and linked to Invoice via hasDetailSection/hasLineItemDetail.",
            "8": "Item information is detailed using properties of P2PItem (LineItem), Price, Quantity, and InvoiceLineItemDetail.",
