            "11": "Invoice amount is modeled by InvoiceAmount class and invoiceAmountValue, linked to SummarySection.",
            "12": "Invoice number is represented by ReferenceNumber and referenceNumberValue, linked to HeaderSection.",
            "13": "File format validity is ensured by presence of all mandatory identifiers (GlobalLocationNumber, ReferenceNumber, DocumentDate, etc.) and structure (InterchangeEnvelope, Message, Segments, etc.).",
